#. Keep the command name, flags and mode values unchanged.
#: src/cli.rs:8
msgid ""
"Agentic Screenshot: skjermbilder til AI-kodeagenter\n"
"\n"
"Bruk:\n"
"  agentic-screenshot            Vis vinduet (starter appen om den ikke kjører)\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --capture  Ta et skjermbilde med sist brukte modus\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --capture --mode omrade|frihand|vindu|skjerm\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --hidden   Start skjult, for autostart\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --quit     Avslutt appen\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --version  Vis versjonen\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --help     Vis denne hjelpen\n"
msgstr ""
"Agentic Screenshot: Bildschirmfotos für KI-Programmieragenten\n"
"\n"
"Aufruf:\n"
"  agentic-screenshot            Fenster anzeigen (startet die App bei Bedarf)\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --capture  Bildschirmfoto im zuletzt verwendeten Modus aufnehmen\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --capture --mode omrade|frihand|vindu|skjerm\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --hidden   Beim Anmelden verborgen starten\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --quit     App beenden\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --version  Version anzeigen\n"
"  agentic-screenshot --help     Diese Hilfe anzeigen\n"

